1. Scope and definitions

This license applies to AbeSweep code, documentation and resources released by
their copyright holder with this license (the "Material"), and to modifications
of that Material ("Modified Versions"). It covers source and compiled forms.
Independent third-party components are excluded and retain their own licenses.
An unrelated program is not a Modified Version merely because it is used with
AbeSweep. "Distribute" means providing a copy to another person or legal entity,
including an affiliated company or a customer. Internal use within the same
legal entity does not by itself constitute distribution.

