license. No ownership is transferred. Rights not granted here are reserved.

3. No sale or paid access

You may not sell, rent, license for a fee, or require payment for access to,
receipt of, or use of the Material or a Modified Version. You may not include
either in a paid software bundle, software subscription or other paid software
product, even if it is labelled a free component or assigned a zero price.
Renaming, modifying or repackaging it does not remove these restrictions.
Making its functionality available to customers as a paid self-service software
service is also prohibited. Optional donations are permitted only when payment
is not a condition of access, receipt, use or any permission under this license.

4. Paid services are permitted

You may charge for actual installation, configuration, maintenance, training
and support work involving the Material. You may use it internally to perform
paid administration or managed services for customers. Such fees must be for
the work, not for the software, its license or access to it, and must not be a
disguised software sale or a paid software bundle. A customer need not purchase
your services to obtain or use the software independently under this license.
Any copy you supply to a customer is a distribution and must also satisfy
sections 5 and 6. Payment for your work alone does not make that copy a sale.

5. Redistribution

Include this license and the applicable copyright and third-party notices with
every distributed copy or substantial portion of the Material. Preserve those
notices. You may distribute unchanged copies free of charge. Do not impose
additional terms or payment conditions that reduce the recipient's permissions
under this license. Recipients receive those permissions directly from the
relevant copyright holders, subject to these same conditions.

6. Modified Versions

If you distribute a Modified Version, you must also:

(a) give it a distinct product name, clearly mark it as unofficial and derived
from AbeSweep, and never present it as an official AbeSweep release;
(b) include a clear record of your changes and their dates;
(c) license your modifications to the Material under this same license; and
(d) supply the complete corresponding editable source, including your changes,
project files and build instructions, free of charge with each distributed
compiled version. A downloadable source archive supplied alongside the binary
in the same release satisfies this requirement; a link to the original,
unmodified AbeSweep source does not. For source-only distributions, supply the
complete modified source and required project files and instructions.

Corresponding source means the preferred form for making changes and what is
needed to build that version. It excludes signing keys, credentials, personal
data and independently available standard tools, SDKs and third-party packages;
identify required dependencies and versions. Third-party license obligations
still apply. Merely packaging an unchanged official binary with this license
and its notices does not make it a Modified Version.

You need not publish private modifications used only within the same legal
entity. If you distribute those modifications later, this section applies.

